    <div id="pnlBenefits" class="jcBand">
	
        <h3 class="postingHeader">Benefits</h3>
        <div class="postingContent">
            <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">As a state employee working for the Department of Developmental Services, you and your family will have access to excellent medical, dental and vision insurance benefits in addition to retirement benefits.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Benefit eligibility may be based on job classification, bargaining unit, time base and length of appointment. Additional benefits may also be outlined for specific bargaining units in employee collective bargaining contracts. For more information, please visit the links below:</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://gcc01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.calhr.ca.gov%2FPages%2FCalifornia-State-Civil-Service-Employee-Benefits-Summary.aspx&amp;data=02%7C01%7CClaudia.Lutz%40DDS.CA.GOV%7Ccbb2ecbf2af44268b93208d7cd21f944%7C7cfc5487eae84559b408d4e67432d3d2%7C0%7C0%7C637203418102901376&amp;sdata=ytRexkkk%2FwV8puIOIHgrGTefhDs6Y%2B0QzkTWmky671Q%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="color: #333333; text-decoration: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration: underline;">California State Employee Benefits Summary</span></a></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalpers.ca.gov%2Fdocs%2Fforms-publications%2F2025-health-benefit-summary.pdf&amp;data=05%7C02%7CAraceli.Strawmier